WEBVTT

00:00:01.410 --> 00:00:05.230
Satoshi, who aims to battle
the Supreme Monarch, Dande...

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:10.240
And Go, who dreams of catching every Pokémon
to work his way up to Mew...

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:15.530
This is the story of
their lives and adventures.

00:01:26.770 --> 00:01:29.110
Satoshi, Go! Big news!

00:01:29.110 --> 00:01:32.590
The Legendary Pokémon Suicune
has appeared!

00:01:32.590 --> 00:01:33.530
Suicune?

00:01:33.530 --> 00:01:34.990
Where?!

00:01:34.990 --> 00:01:39.180
Reports of Suicune sightings
are concentrated in this area!

00:01:39.710 --> 00:01:45.320
Suicune is said to travel all over the world,
purifying dirty waters.

00:01:45.320 --> 00:01:49.500
Apparently the area’s been having storms,
and the lake water had become muddy.

00:01:50.050 --> 00:01:53.250
Then Suicune appeared,
and purified the water!

00:01:56.410 --> 00:01:58.210
What a nice guy,
that Suicune!

00:01:58.210 --> 00:02:01.760
A nice guy...? You <i>do</i> know
it’s a Legendary Pokémon, right?

00:02:01.760 --> 00:02:06.840
That kindness would be why it earned people’s admiration
and became a legend, don’t you think?

00:02:06.840 --> 00:02:08.770
But this is a bit strange...

00:02:09.480 --> 00:02:13.940
Usually Suicune purifies water
and then leaves to go elsewhere.

00:02:14.570 --> 00:02:17.930
But this time, it seems to be staying
near this one lake.

00:02:17.930 --> 00:02:19.200
I wonder why...

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:23.030
And that’s what I’d like you two
Research Fellows to investigate!

00:02:23.590 --> 00:02:24.160
Right!

00:02:25.010 --> 00:02:27.470
Okay, let’s... Go!

00:02:27.470 --> 00:02:29.150
Go!

00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:08.640
Johto Region

00:04:08.640 --> 00:04:11.680
Seeking the Legendary
Pokémon Suicune,
Johto Region

00:04:11.680 --> 00:04:16.360
Satoshi and Go have headed deep into
the mountains, where it was sighted.

00:04:20.650 --> 00:04:22.510
What’s this stench...?

00:04:22.510 --> 00:04:24.410
It stinks!

00:04:25.060 --> 00:04:26.050
It’s this way.

00:04:35.640 --> 00:04:38.890
This is the lake where
Suicune was sighted...?

00:04:38.890 --> 00:04:40.700
Why’s it look like this?!

00:04:40.700 --> 00:04:44.030
Didn’t they say Suicune purified it?

00:04:44.550 --> 00:04:46.660
Betobeton! Sludge Bomb!

00:04:48.150 --> 00:04:50.180
Yabukuron, do it!

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:57.160
What’re they doing?

00:04:57.160 --> 00:04:59.270
They look pretty shady...

00:04:59.270 --> 00:05:01.500
We should contact Miss Junsa...

00:05:02.050 --> 00:05:02.900
Satoshi!

00:05:05.890 --> 00:05:07.390
Stop it!

00:05:08.430 --> 00:05:10.160
Who’re you now?

00:05:10.570 --> 00:05:11.910
Ahhh...

00:05:11.910 --> 00:05:13.840
Scram!
This ain’t none of your business!

00:05:13.840 --> 00:05:15.900
Yabukuron, Sludge Bomb!

00:05:18.940 --> 00:05:21.250
Pikachu! Iron Tail!

00:05:27.660 --> 00:05:28.800
What’d you do that for?!

00:05:28.800 --> 00:05:31.510
Gah... Aceburn!

00:05:33.820 --> 00:05:34.390
Go!

00:05:34.390 --> 00:05:36.780
Satoshi,
you’re always too reckless!

00:05:36.780 --> 00:05:38.190
I couldn’t just leave them!

00:05:38.190 --> 00:05:39.770
You want a fight?

00:05:39.770 --> 00:05:43.900
Hey! This ain’t the time
to be playin’ with kids!

00:05:44.580 --> 00:05:46.360
<i>Boss!</i>

00:05:48.230 --> 00:05:49.490
It’s here.

00:06:00.870 --> 00:06:02.170
Suicune!

00:06:02.170 --> 00:06:03.630
It really was here!

00:06:30.700 --> 00:06:33.160
I see you’ve got power.

00:06:33.160 --> 00:06:37.440
But by now, you’ve gotta be
running outta stamina, eh?

00:06:38.040 --> 00:06:40.410
They’re Pokémon Hunters!

00:06:40.410 --> 00:06:44.950
I get it! They’re trying to
weaken Suicune and catch it!

00:06:48.760 --> 00:06:50.970
Now! Attack!

00:06:50.970 --> 00:06:51.750
Sludge Bomb!

00:06:51.750 --> 00:06:52.370
Matadogas!

00:06:52.370 --> 00:06:53.220
Sludge Bomb!

00:07:03.550 --> 00:07:04.570
Suicune!

00:07:07.120 --> 00:07:08.650
Stay out of our way!

00:07:08.650 --> 00:07:10.790
Dustdas, Sludge Bomb!

00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:19.020
We have to save it...

00:07:19.020 --> 00:07:21.290
But how...?

00:07:28.190 --> 00:07:30.950
The future lies in my hands!

00:07:30.950 --> 00:07:33.780
Monster Ball, go!

00:07:49.940 --> 00:07:53.490
Suicune’s data will be
added to the index!

00:07:54.950 --> 00:07:55.730
Whaaaat?!

00:07:55.730 --> 00:07:56.990
<i>No way!</i>

00:07:57.450 --> 00:08:00.200
Now Suicune is with us!

00:08:00.200 --> 00:08:02.500
So give up and go home!

00:08:02.500 --> 00:08:06.890
Can’t say I’m impressed with you just coming in
and stealing it after <i>we</i> did all the work.

00:08:06.890 --> 00:08:10.880
Guess we’d better teach you
what the rules are.

00:08:10.880 --> 00:08:12.400
What’re you talking about?!

00:08:12.400 --> 00:08:14.010
You were the ones
messing everything up!

00:08:14.010 --> 00:08:16.930
This is how we handle things.

00:08:17.350 --> 00:08:20.220
We take what we want,
by force!

00:08:21.660 --> 00:08:22.440
Lucario!

00:08:25.290 --> 00:08:26.480
Get out of here, Go!

00:08:26.480 --> 00:08:27.320
But...

00:08:27.930 --> 00:08:29.940
Right now,
we need to protect Suicune!

00:08:32.110 --> 00:08:35.550
Got it. Let’s go,
Aceburn, Messon.

00:08:36.820 --> 00:08:37.660
Don’t let him go!

00:08:38.170 --> 00:08:39.160
I won’t let you!

00:08:39.160 --> 00:08:40.790
Damn you...

00:08:40.790 --> 00:08:42.870
Pikachu! Lightning Speed!

00:08:42.870 --> 00:08:44.770
Lucario! Aura Sphere!

00:08:49.820 --> 00:08:52.630
You better be okay,
Satoshi!

00:09:12.440 --> 00:09:15.920
Suicune! We have to get you
to the Pokémon Center!

00:09:15.920 --> 00:09:17.200
Return—

00:09:18.930 --> 00:09:20.470
You need to understand!

00:09:20.470 --> 00:09:23.910
If you don’t run before they catch up,
you could get hurt!

00:09:53.770 --> 00:09:55.080
Poppo?!

00:09:59.390 --> 00:10:01.780
They’re protecting Suicune?

00:10:01.780 --> 00:10:07.870
I get it. Suicune helped all of you
by purifying the water.

00:10:09.510 --> 00:10:12.840
I’m not one of
the Pokémon Hunters!

00:10:12.840 --> 00:10:15.550
...Well, saying that myself
doesn’t mean much...

00:10:16.160 --> 00:10:19.050
I guess all I can do here
is help you get better.

00:10:21.100 --> 00:10:22.700
All right...!

00:10:30.570 --> 00:10:34.910
Aceburn, you protect Suicune.
I’ll be counting on you if those guys turn up.

00:10:35.710 --> 00:10:38.550
Raichu and Messon,
you come with me.

00:10:39.750 --> 00:10:41.320
Nasshi, keep watch for us!

00:11:00.970 --> 00:11:02.250
You find them?

00:11:02.250 --> 00:11:03.100
No...

00:11:03.100 --> 00:11:05.060
Damn...!

00:11:11.290 --> 00:11:12.340
Lucario.

00:11:16.290 --> 00:11:19.110
I wonder if Go’s okay...

00:11:23.630 --> 00:11:24.860
I’m back!

00:11:39.300 --> 00:11:40.920
Go on, eat up.

00:11:40.920 --> 00:11:43.510
They’re poison-curing berries.

00:12:02.040 --> 00:12:03.860
I bet you’re hungry, too.

00:12:03.860 --> 00:12:07.040
I picked lots of berries,
so dig in, everyone!

00:12:18.090 --> 00:12:20.580
If you can just get
your stamina back...

00:12:34.240 --> 00:12:37.230
Boss!
We found where they’re hiding!

00:12:37.890 --> 00:12:39.140
You did?

00:12:39.140 --> 00:12:39.980
Yeah!

00:12:41.290 --> 00:12:44.370
Looking down on us like that...

00:12:44.370 --> 00:12:46.490
We’re gonna make them pay for that!

00:12:47.550 --> 00:12:49.380
Pocket Monsters!

00:13:03.670 --> 00:13:06.610
No good...
It won’t connect...

00:13:13.270 --> 00:13:14.800
You’re hurt!

00:13:21.840 --> 00:13:23.360
Come on, just let me see.

00:13:32.620 --> 00:13:34.130
Did that sting?

00:13:35.120 --> 00:13:37.120
Sorry about that...

00:13:38.080 --> 00:13:40.610
I’m glad I brought this.

00:13:42.130 --> 00:13:44.500
Thanks, Koharu.

00:13:44.500 --> 00:13:45.630
That should do it.

00:13:46.340 --> 00:13:47.950
It’ll be all fixed soon.

00:13:53.900 --> 00:13:55.130
They’re here, then...

00:14:00.460 --> 00:14:02.020
So there they were.

00:14:02.440 --> 00:14:03.750
Betobeton! Sludge B—

00:14:03.750 --> 00:14:05.150
Lightning Speed!

00:14:07.400 --> 00:14:09.110
Psybeam!

00:14:11.760 --> 00:14:12.620
What?!

00:14:12.620 --> 00:14:18.450
I made sure to catch a Psychic-type Pokémon,
which are good against Poison types, just in case!

00:14:26.050 --> 00:14:27.510
All right!

00:14:27.510 --> 00:14:31.390
Sleep’s data will be
added to the index!

00:14:31.600 --> 00:14:33.630
Let’s go, Sleep!

00:14:38.300 --> 00:14:40.940
So what? Get him!

00:14:40.940 --> 00:14:42.820
Yabukuron! Pound!

00:14:44.150 --> 00:14:46.440
Sleep, you use Pound, too!

00:14:51.530 --> 00:14:52.990
Psybeam!

00:14:55.990 --> 00:14:57.790
Aceburn! Pyro Ball!

00:15:01.570 --> 00:15:03.940
Use Psybeam, Sleep!

00:15:11.050 --> 00:15:12.850
All right! We can win this!

00:15:16.110 --> 00:15:17.570
You think you’re so clever,
don’t you?

00:15:17.570 --> 00:15:18.230
Boss!

00:15:18.230 --> 00:15:19.940
Go, Hellgar!

00:15:21.200 --> 00:15:22.790
Crunch!

00:15:25.040 --> 00:15:26.190
Sleep!

00:15:27.280 --> 00:15:30.650
You thought we
only had Poison types?

00:15:31.250 --> 00:15:33.150
You rest up, Sleep.

00:15:34.270 --> 00:15:36.420
And the tables have turned.

00:15:37.980 --> 00:15:39.080
Catch it!

00:15:47.880 --> 00:15:49.470
Stop wriggling!

00:15:51.410 --> 00:15:52.430
Stop it!

00:15:56.960 --> 00:15:58.020
Stop...

00:16:01.020 --> 00:16:02.190
Stop it!

00:16:02.190 --> 00:16:04.480
Pikachu! Lightning Speed!

00:16:07.440 --> 00:16:09.230
Lucario! Aura Sphere!

00:16:15.700 --> 00:16:17.580
Go!

00:16:18.130 --> 00:16:19.240
Are you okay?

00:16:19.240 --> 00:16:20.580
Thanks, Satoshi!

00:16:20.580 --> 00:16:22.540
You were still here?

00:16:22.540 --> 00:16:24.460
Hellgar! Flamethrower!

00:16:30.770 --> 00:16:31.510
Pikachu!

00:16:31.510 --> 00:16:32.630
Sludge Bomb!

00:16:34.800 --> 00:16:36.450
Pyro Ball!

00:16:41.930 --> 00:16:42.980
Sludge Bomb!

00:16:52.580 --> 00:16:53.610
Aceburn!

00:17:06.880 --> 00:17:09.380
We can’t give up now!

00:17:13.760 --> 00:17:17.390
I’m gonna defend the future
I’ve held in my hands!

00:17:21.630 --> 00:17:23.670
Will you just give it up already?!

00:17:23.670 --> 00:17:25.100
I’ll finish you off!

00:17:25.100 --> 00:17:26.650
Crunch!

00:17:45.860 --> 00:17:47.040
Suicune...

00:17:54.690 --> 00:17:57.190
You’re going to fight with us?

00:18:00.220 --> 00:18:03.430
All right, Suicune!
Hydro Pump!

00:18:12.650 --> 00:18:14.530
Amazing!

00:18:16.750 --> 00:18:19.080
Hellgar! Flamethrower!

00:18:19.910 --> 00:18:21.950
Ice Beam!

00:18:38.590 --> 00:18:40.220
Hold on, Suicune.

00:18:47.870 --> 00:18:49.190
You did it.

00:18:49.190 --> 00:18:51.710
Now, what should we
do with them?

00:18:51.710 --> 00:18:53.150
I’ll do <i>this!</i>

00:18:53.150 --> 00:18:55.610
Suicune, I’m counting on you.
Ice Beam!

00:19:03.310 --> 00:19:05.700
Thank you for all of your help!

00:19:06.220 --> 00:19:10.310
They were a vicious gang of hunters,
wanted by the police.

00:19:12.500 --> 00:19:14.620
We’ll take care of the rest!

00:19:14.620 --> 00:19:15.880
Thank you!

00:19:31.150 --> 00:19:32.430
Go?

00:19:32.430 --> 00:19:34.520
You have an
important journey, yeah?

00:19:34.520 --> 00:19:36.020
See ya, Suicune!

00:19:37.230 --> 00:19:39.180
You don’t have to do that!

00:19:39.180 --> 00:19:41.130
S-Shush!

00:19:46.710 --> 00:19:48.030
Suicune?

00:20:08.080 --> 00:20:10.420
Thank you, Suicune.

00:20:13.370 --> 00:20:14.560
Come on out!

00:20:18.450 --> 00:20:21.820
I didn’t think I’d ever
see it this close...

00:20:21.820 --> 00:20:25.740
Awesome!
You really <i>did</i> catch Suicune!

00:20:25.740 --> 00:20:27.700
It’s so pretty...!

00:20:37.500 --> 00:20:38.910
Suicune?

00:21:06.120 --> 00:21:07.530
Where’s Suicune?

00:21:08.690 --> 00:21:09.370
It’s there.

00:21:11.490 --> 00:21:13.630
It’s there,
even if we can’t see it.

00:21:14.670 --> 00:21:16.050
I can tell.

00:21:17.700 --> 00:21:20.630
I get it. Yeah, that’s right!

00:21:21.060 --> 00:21:25.760
Go has formed a clear bond
with the Legendary Pokémon, Suicune.

00:21:25.760 --> 00:21:28.450
It’s a large step towards his dream.

00:21:29.110 --> 00:21:33.720
But the world still holds
many more Pokémon.

00:21:33.720 --> 00:21:38.260
Will they ever come to meet
every Pokémon?

00:21:51.000 --> 00:21:51.770
Mew!

00:21:51.770 --> 00:21:52.520
Warrgle!

00:21:52.520 --> 00:21:53.310
Runpappa!

00:21:53.310 --> 00:21:54.080
Pawou!

00:21:54.080 --> 00:21:54.820
Ulgamoth!

00:21:54.820 --> 00:21:55.610
Strike!

00:21:55.610 --> 00:21:56.410
Cresselia!

00:21:56.410 --> 00:21:57.120
Amakaji!

00:21:57.120 --> 00:21:57.930
Jirachi!

00:21:57.930 --> 00:21:58.730
Chobomaki!

00:21:58.730 --> 00:21:59.500
Kibago!

00:21:59.500 --> 00:22:00.270
Gonbe!

00:22:00.270 --> 00:22:01.050
Bayleaf!

00:22:01.050 --> 00:22:02.550
Freezer!

00:22:02.550 --> 00:22:03.740
Zacian!

00:22:19.820 --> 00:22:20.590
Mew!

00:22:20.590 --> 00:22:21.420
Wooper!

00:22:21.420 --> 00:22:22.140
Pachirisu!

00:22:22.140 --> 00:22:22.990
Sunaba!

00:22:22.990 --> 00:22:23.650
Absol!

00:22:23.650 --> 00:22:24.510
Lunala!

00:22:24.510 --> 00:22:25.320
Rabbifoot!

00:22:25.320 --> 00:22:26.100
Tropius!

00:22:26.100 --> 00:22:26.870
Sunahebi!

00:22:26.870 --> 00:22:27.740
Vibrava!

00:22:27.740 --> 00:22:28.390
Burshamo!

00:22:28.390 --> 00:22:29.160
Mokuroh!

00:22:29.160 --> 00:22:29.980
Rotom!

00:22:29.980 --> 00:22:30.700
Mooland!

00:22:30.700 --> 00:22:31.480
Dodorio!

00:22:31.480 --> 00:22:32.200
Otosupus!

00:22:32.200 --> 00:22:33.020
Swanna!

00:22:33.020 --> 00:22:33.770
Nazonokusa!

00:22:33.770 --> 00:22:34.590
Samehada!

00:22:34.590 --> 00:22:35.360
Darkrai!

00:22:35.360 --> 00:22:36.040
Iwanko!

00:22:36.040 --> 00:22:36.870
Cortoise!

00:22:36.870 --> 00:22:37.700
Scorupi!

00:22:37.700 --> 00:22:38.480
Pippi!

00:22:38.480 --> 00:22:39.200
Pinpuku!

00:22:39.200 --> 00:22:39.980
Kunugidama!

00:22:39.980 --> 00:22:40.720
Mankey!

00:22:40.720 --> 00:22:41.530
Kimori!

00:22:41.530 --> 00:22:42.350
Ligray!

00:22:42.350 --> 00:22:43.780
Rayquaza!

00:22:43.780 --> 00:22:44.510
Zamazenta!

00:23:07.200 --> 00:23:09.620
Now! Onto the next adventure!

00:23:09.620 --> 00:23:10.910
Go!

00:23:12.370 --> 00:23:14.730
A tiny little Pokémon,
shy as could be.

00:23:15.410 --> 00:23:20.040
One meeting would serve
to greatly change its destiny.

00:23:20.040 --> 00:23:21.360
You must be scared, Messon.

00:23:21.360 --> 00:23:24.960
But this is something only you can do,
a battle only you can fight!

00:23:25.710 --> 00:23:28.870
A shocking true story
that brought all of Kanto to tears.

00:23:28.870 --> 00:23:31.190
Next time, on Pocket Monsters:

00:23:31.190 --> 00:23:33.960
Messon: Impossible!
